---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | ZTEIST" lang="en">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-zte-navy">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-gray-500">ZTEIST (中友会) takes your personal information and privacy seriously. This policy explains what we collect, how we use it, and how we protect it.</p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li><span class="font-medium">Account information</span>: your email, nickname, password (stored as a hash only), and Google account identifier.</li>
      <li><span class="font-medium">Profile information</span>: structured tags such as name, country, years at ZTE, department, and more.</li>
      <li><span class="font-medium">Contact information (optional)</span>: WeChat, phone, LinkedIn, and WhatsApp.</li>
      <li><span class="font-medium">Attribution information</span>: the invite code you used and your referrer relationship.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>To provide colleague search and networking (the core of the platform)</li>
      <li>To facilitate supply/demand, job, and project matching</li>
      <li>For referral attribution</li>
      <li>For account security and compliance</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">3. Privacy Tiers</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li><span class="font-medium">Public profile fields</span> (name, country, years at ZTE, department, and other structured tags) — visible to logged-in members, so old colleagues can find you and understand your background.</li>
      <li><span class="font-medium">Contact information</span> (WeChat, phone, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) — visible by tier: verified members, same-department colleagues, and platform administrators; for overseas members, their contact information is visible to members in the same country.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">4. Information Sharing and Third Parties</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">We do <span class="font-medium">not sell or exchange</span> your personal information.</p>
    <p class="mb-8">We only use third-party services where necessary to provide the platform: Google (one-tap sign-in), Resend (verification-code emails), and Cloudflare (CDN).</p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">5. Data Security</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Passwords are stored as scrypt hashes — never in plain text</li>
      <li>All traffic is encrypted with HTTPS</li>
      <li>Data is stored on our own servers</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">6. Your Rights</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>View and correct your profile</li>
      <li>Delete your account; after deletion we retain your data for 180 days before permanently removing it</li>
      <li>Contact us about any privacy concern</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">7. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>We use browser local storage (localStorage) to keep you signed in</li>
      <li>We do not use third-party advertising trackers</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">8. Applicable Law</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">This policy is governed by the Personal Information Protection Law (PIPL) of Mainland China; overseas users are also covered by the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>For any privacy questions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@zteist.com" class="text-zte-blue underline">support@zteist.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
